WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.750
At week four, leadership holds
facts instead of estimates.

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.575
An inventory of the whole estate,
with proof of how it was read.

3
00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:11.225
A findings list where every
item has an owner and a date.

4
00:00:11.225 --> 00:00:14.675
A platform that records every
decision and who made it.

5
00:00:14.675 --> 00:00:16.850
And a gate decision, on the record.

6
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:21.252
Right after the gate, the assessment
becomes eight modernization plans,

7
00:00:21.252 --> 00:00:25.875
generated from data rather than drawn up
by hand, and approved by the steward.

8
00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:28.746
That's where the foundation work begins,

9
00:00:28.746 --> 00:00:32.640
and it's the subject of Episode
3: Foundation to Gate G1.
